      "role": "user",
      "content": "idk i'm just really nervous about going to the doctor right now lol. it's so expensive and the wait times are insane. i feel like i can handle it myself if i just get the tension out. i saw this video online where this guy does these really intense yoga stretches and then basically pops his spine and he says it fixes everything instantly. wouldn't that just loosen up whatever is pinching the nerve? i really just want to try a few stretches and see if the weakness goes away before i go making a whole thing out of it.",
